    "updated_at": "2022-09-13T06:59:57Z",
    "body": "`Document.adoptNode` also reparents in Gecko. I don't know of any plans to change that at this point, though we never got cross-browser agreement on it (eg see also the mega-thread at https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=20567).",
